        "decoderHTML": "The <a href=\"#prandtl-drag/CDi\" class=\"phrase phrase-red phrase-boxed active\" data-term=\"CDi\">extra drag created by lift</a> grows with the square of the <a href=\"#prandtl-drag/CL\" class=\"phrase phrase-green\" data-term=\"CL\">lift coefficient</a>, but drops when you increase <a href=\"#prandtl-drag/AR\" class=\"phrase phrase-blue\" data-term=\"AR\">wing aspect ratio</a> or <a href=\"#prandtl-drag/e\" class=\"phrase phrase-purple\" data-term=\"e\">span efficiency</a>.",
